# the machine pipeline over the corpus: every IR text file under test/ir goes
# through the schedule, selection, allocation and the frame at every level, on
# every target that carries a machine, and the result is checked
#
# a target takes part when it declares a convention, a baseline and a
# selection table, so a target added later joins by declaring its rows. a file
# whose target carries none stays out of the walk, and that is the only reason
# a file stays out. the checks read liveness of the allocated function, so
# they do not trust the allocator's own proof:
#
# - no clobbered location holds a value across the call that clobbers it,
# - every piece of an entry arrives in its placed register or incoming slot,
#   and nothing else a call may clobber is read before it is written.

